    <item>
      <title>Saudi Arabia Has Few Options as Houthis Aim at Heart of Its Ambitions</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/11/world/middleeast/saudi-arabia-options-houthis.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/11/world/middleeast/saudi-arabia-options-houthis.html</guid>
      <ns0:link href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/11/world/middleeast/saudi-arabia-options-houthis.html" rel="standout" />
      <description>Three deadly attacks by the Iran-backed Houthis in Yemen on an airport in the Saudi capital underscored the asymmetrical nature of their conflict with the kingdom.</description>
      <pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 19:57:48 +0000</pubDate>
      <category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/des">War and Armed Conflicts</category>
