    <item>
      <title>Ukraine Shrugs Off Trump Call to Ditch Zelensky for Energy Strikes</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/11/world/europe/trump-zelensky-diesel-energy-russia-.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/11/world/europe/trump-zelensky-diesel-energy-russia-.html</guid>
      <ns0:link href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/11/world/europe/trump-zelensky-diesel-energy-russia-.html" rel="standout" />
      <description>President Trump lashed out at President Volodymyr Zelensky for striking Russian oil refineries. Mr. Zelensky said he’ll stop — if Russia does too.</description>
