    <item>
      <title>Wringing Hope From the Rubble of Gaza</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/11/world/middleeast/wringing-hope-from-the-rubble-of-gaza.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/11/world/middleeast/wringing-hope-from-the-rubble-of-gaza.html</guid>
      <ns0:link href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/11/world/middleeast/wringing-hope-from-the-rubble-of-gaza.html" rel="standout" />
      <description>The cease-fire last October ostensibly brought an end to Israel’s war in Gaza after the Hamas-led attacks on Oct. 7, 2023. A year later, however, Israeli strikes, though less frequent, haven’t stopped.</description>
      <pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 11:25:54 +0000</pubDate>
      <category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/des">Palestinians</category>
      <category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_geo">Gaza Strip</category>
      <category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/des">Refugees and Displaced Persons</category>
      <category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/des">Civilian Casualties</category>
      <category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/des">Peace Process</category>
      <category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_org">Hamas</category>
      <category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/des">Terrorism</category>
      <category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_geo">Israel</category>
      <category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/des">Defense and Military Forces</category>
      <category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/des">Israel-Gaza War (2023- )</category>
      <category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/des">War Crimes, Genocide and Crimes Against Humanity</category>
      <category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/des">vis-photo</category>
      <ns1:content height="1800" medium="image" url="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/09/22/multimedia/22Gaza-ceasefire-anniversary-05-hjvz/22Gaza-ceasefire-anniversary-05-hjvz-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg" width="1800" />
      <ns1:description>It’s been a year since Israel and Hamas signed an agreement to end the war in Gaza. But life in Gaza looks nothing like peace.</ns1:description>
    </item>
